{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Waking up in the Night ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > Dreams: What Do Yours Mean?", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intake", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the amount of food or drink that you take into your body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd better cut down on my caffeine intake.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about healthy habits related to sleep.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gradually", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening slowly over a long period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should gradually cut down on coffee. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " tea", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a drink made from leaves that are  heated with steam", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I used to drink tea when I was in China.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chamomile tea", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tea made from a plant with small white and yellow flowers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I drink chamomile tea before going to bed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a good night's sleep", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when you wake up in the morning feeling alert and refreshed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I just want a good night's sleep. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "therapeutic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel calm and relaxed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I find writing in a journal to be very therapeutic. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "What haven't you done?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can talk about what you have not done", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect in negative to express what experiences you haven't had or things you haven't done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject<br/>I/you/we/they <br/> He/she</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ auxiliary <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">haven't</span> <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">hasn't</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"underline\\\">past participle</span>*</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "*For irregular verbs you use the past participle.<br/>For regular verbs you add <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> at the end of the verb in the infinitive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">haven't</span> <span class=\"underline\">drunk</span> any tea since I was in China.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">haven't</span> <span class=\"underline\">slept</span> for eight hours in ages!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She <span class=\"strong\">hasn't</span> <span class=\"underline\">cut</span> down her caffeine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You <span class=\"strong\">haven't</span> <span class=\"underline\">started</span> a sleep diary.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can offer advice and solutions to people on how to improve their habits or well-being. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to give a solution. <br/><br/>When offering advice and solutions, you can also use adverbs of manner to describe how something should be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:  <ul><li>You should ...</li> <li>You could ...</li> <li>You might ...</li> <li>You need to ...</li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li> <li>You had better ... (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You ought to cut down on the coffee slowly. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should drink more tea. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You need to think carefully. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'd better do this quickly.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out what a sleep diary looks like. How is the page organized?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a 5 day sleep diary for yourself using the example you found.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Fill out the sleep diary for 5 days.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After the 5 days, look at your entries. What can you say about your sleeping schedule? What would you change? Why?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your findings with a partner. Listen to their findings. Can you offer them any advice or solutions about their sleeping habits?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about experiences I have or haven't had in a sleep diary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about how something happens.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I offer my partner advice or a solution about their sleeping habits.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob02re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le08ob02re2img06.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob02re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I really need to cut down on my caffeine intake.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mhmm, Sally. You should give it up slowly, you know? You ought to gradually cut back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You might want to try some tea instead. You like tea don't you?", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmmm ... I haven't drunk any tea since I was in China. I used to drink tea every morning!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've started to drink chamomile tea. I've read that it helps with falling asleep and at this point, I need all the help I can get!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're still having trouble sleeping?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, I find myself repeatedly waking up throughout the night. I just want a good night's sleep.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You ought to try to naturally adjust your sleep-wake cycle.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My sleep ... what cycle?", "id": 2, "time": "15000"}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob02re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It refers to the 24 hours in a day. You're awake for 16 and sleep for 8.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't slept for 8 hours in ages!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You might want to start a sleep diary?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Cute, Sally.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've found writing down my thoughts in a diary to be therapeutic. You might want to try it out. You may even find it helps you develop some good habits!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I guess I can try.", "id": 3, "time": "48300"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": []}}], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary an Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": " I can offer advice and solutions about healthy habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about how something happens or how someone behaves. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What time do you wake up? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you woken up in the middle of the 